{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/symptoms/musculoskeletal-pain/","title":"허리·목·무릎 통증","language":"ko-KR","description":"허리·목·무릎 등 근골격계 통증을 어혈·풍한습비·허손과 침·약침·전침·부항·독활기생탕으로 연결합니다.","text":"허리·목·무릎 통증\n근골격계 통증은 통증 부위뿐 아니라 어혈·풍한습비·기혈허·간신부족 등의 상태를 함께 고려한다.\n부위별\n요통\n목통증\n무릎통증\n어깨통증\n치료\n침\n약침\n전침\n부항\n방제\n→ 독활기생탕\n→ 통증·근골격 허브\n→ 질환→치료 통합 지도","headings":[{"level":2,"title":"부위별","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/symptoms/musculoskeletal-pain/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"치료","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/symptoms/musculoskeletal-pain/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"방제","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/symptoms/musculoskeletal-pain/#_4"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/knee-pain/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/low-back-pain/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/neck-pain/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/conditions/shoulder-pain/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/formulas/duhuo-jisheng-tang/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/network/condition-to-treatment-map/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/pillar/pain-musculoskeletal/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/treatments/acupuncture/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/treatments/cupping/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/treatments/electroacupuncture/","https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/treatments/pharmacopuncture/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","last_reviewed":"2026-08-19"}
